• The test: ids_no_vendor_serves_are_not_offered_and_warn_when_typed checks that:
  • no provider list offers any of the five;
  • none is a default;
  • typing one triggers the warning;
  • the real model next to each one (o4-mini, gpt-5.5, MiniMax-M1, llama-3.3-70b-versatile, grok-4.7) stays offered with no warning.

